{"id":"n38346-1-9","stage":4,"title":"기술 · 记述","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38346-1-9-1","ko":"그건 무슨 자료예요?","zh":"那是什么资料啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그건","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그건","audio":"/audio/cf51c782be532a251c41.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"자료예요?","meaning":"资料","explanation":"자료：资料；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"자료","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62401","senseId":"1","lemma":"자료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자료예요","audio":"/audio/39ecd8c53f22f45f7985.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"6416867e47259489","term":"자료","zh":"资料","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3","entryId":"62401","definition":"做研究或调查最基本的材料。","pronunciation":["자료"]}],"audio":"/audio/077b935acb76083d9840.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38346-1-9-2","ko":"청소년들의 언어 사용 실태에 관해 기술을 한 보고서예요.","zh":"这是一份关于青少年语言使用现状的报告。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"청소년들의","meaning":"青少年","explanation":"청소년：青少年；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"청소년","audio":"/audio/484d1e4823fbd3e18388.mp3"}